{"id":"328285b7fc95ea2f","group":"88","path":"88/88-fact-functions-uncountable.md","title":"fact-functions-uncountable — Total Functions Uncountable","display":"fact-functions-uncountable — Total Functions Uncountable","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-fact-functions-uncountable","aliases":["88-fact-functions-uncountable"],"display":"fact-functions-uncountable — Total Functions Uncountable","depends_on":["[[88-df-computable-function]]","[[88-df-cardinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-fact-functions-uncountable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-fact-functions-uncountable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-functions-uncountable — Total Functions Uncountable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}^\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}^\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set of all total functions on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\\)</span> (computability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> (class of total computable functions)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}functions\\text{-}uncountable} \\vdash\n\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{tot}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}:\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\\},\n\\qquad\n|\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{tot}}|\n\\leq\\omega\n&lt;\n|\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}functions\\text{-}uncountable} \\vdash\n\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{tot}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}:\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\\},\n\\qquad\n|\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{tot}}|\n\\leq\\omega\n&lt;\n|\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}^\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}^\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> : 全函数集合 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>)</li>\n<li>可计算函数由有限程序编号，故至多可数；全部自然数函数由对角论证不可数。</li>\n<li>存在不可计算的函数</li>\n<li>Cantor对角化的直接应用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"3fb55f9cf4d73400","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","